    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, ibuprofen?? i thought i wasn't supposed to take that with warfarin because of the bleeding risk? my doctor mentioned something about NSAIDs being dangerous. and is it really okay to just take the vitamin K without checking my levels first? i'm just a bit nervous because i've been feeling a little dizzy when i stand up too.",
